<title>FINLAND: Amer falls to FIM 234 mln 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>Amer falls to FIM 234 mln 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Loss before extraordinary items, tax	 234 vs 140 profit</p>
<p> Loss per share (markka)			 7.40 vs 3.10 profit</p>
<p> Net sales					  4,958 vs 6,166</p>
<p> Operating loss				     120 vs 263 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish sporting goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy had been for a 205 million markka loss.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 253 vs 238</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 114 vs 123 charge</p>
<p> Taxes					    gain 61 vs 67 charge</p>
<p> Minorities				    charge 3 vs 2 gain</p>
<p> Loss before extraordinary items		176 vs 75 profit</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		     charge 150 vs 73 charge</p>
<p> Net loss					     326 vs 2 profit</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)		44 vs 47</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Amer-yhtyma Oy.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245</p>
</text>
